&amp;#x003C;img src=&quot;1116.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; title=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;200&quot; height=&quot;100&quot; /&amp;#x003E;

Quanto vale il modulo della forza &amp;#x003C;i&amp;#x003E;F&amp;#x003C;/i&amp;#x003E; della forza?</question>
<clue></clue>
<category></category>
<weighting>100</weighting>
<fixed>0</fixed>
<question-type>1</question-type>
<answers>
<answer><text>3.6 N</text>
<feedback></feedback>
<correct>0</correct>
<percent-correct>0</percent-correct>
<include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options>
</answer><answer><text>5.4 N</text>
<feedback></feedback>
<correct>0</correct>
<percent-correct>0</percent-correct>
<include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options>
</answer><answer><text>7.2 N</text>
<feedback></feedback>
<correct>0</correct>
<percent-correct>0</percent-correct>
<include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options>
</answer><answer><text>9.0 N</text>
<feedback></feedback>
<correct>0</correct>
<percent-correct>0</percent-correct>
<include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options>
</answer><answer><text>14.4 N</text>
<feedback></feedback>
<correct>1</correct>
<percent-correct>100</percent-correct>
<include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options>
</answer></answers>
